source: crates/oxc_formatter_css/tests/fixtures/mod.rs
---
==================== Input ====================
// A custom property value runs to the top-level `;` (css-syntax §5.5.6);
// dart-sass reads it as text, so a `;`-less `{...}` block followed by more
// text is ONE declaration and prints verbatim, like Prettier.
// Splitting it would make `--another-prop` resolvable where the source has none.
:root {
  --like-a-apply-rule: {
  color:red;} /* no semi here*/
  --another-prop: blue;
}

